    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Rare</em></p><p>As a Magic action while wearing this bracelet, you can target a Large or smaller creature within 5 feet of yourself that has the &amp;Reference[Grappled apply=false] or &amp;Reference[Incapacitated apply=false] condition. The target must succeed on a DC 15 Dexterity saving throw or be magically bound to you by a spectral chain and manacle that spring from the bracelet.</p><p>While bound this way, the creature has the &amp;Reference[Restrained apply=false] condition, and when you move, it moves with you.</p><p>A creature stays bound for 8 hours or until you release it (no action required). If the manacle takes damage from a @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDisintegra]{Disintegrate} spell, it is destroyed; nothing else can break or harm it. Once the manacle has bound a creature, it can’t be used this way again until the next dawn.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
